<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hayes Wheels, Citation started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hayes Wheels, Citation started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Hayes Wheels International Inc and Citation Corp with buy ratings, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Eric Goldstein was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
